# #148 Long Rifles and #144 special cues: Rifleman's fourth blaster shot is the Long Rifle; every special form shows its Warcraft spell.
# Rifleman a against an idle Rifleman b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero rifleman
# #148: three blaster shots fill the counter; the fourth is the Long Rifle.
60 a tap X 2
62 a capture
69 a capture
80 a capture
110 a tap X 2
112 a capture
119 a capture
130 a capture
160 a tap X 2
162 a capture
169 a capture
180 a capture
210 a tap X 2
212 a capture
219 a capture
230 a capture
# #144: a short-hop blaster.
270 a tap B 1
275 a tap X 2
277 a capture
284 a capture
# #144: the bear toward b.
330 a stick 1 0
330 a tap X 2
331 a stick 0 0
332 a capture
354 a capture
# #144: Freeze Trap.
420 a stick 0 -1
420 a tap X 2
421 a stick 0 0
422 a capture
424 a capture
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
# #144: Recoil Shot, second shot on its frame 17.
640 a stick 0 1
640 a tap X 2
641 a stick 0 0
642 a capture
644 a capture
656 a tap X 2
